<task id="081" project="ebilling-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>RuleSetService scope validation, scope lock, BU writes, routed ownership; census Waived to Routed; guard and twin guard; sprk_ruleset lineage</title>
    <phase>3 Rules (WP3) — rule-set scope (D-171, D-172), wave W3-7</phase>
    <gate>080 done; Q11 (uac-r2) gates step 7 only</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Authorization (a new Read + AppendTo operation key), record ownership routing on Secure records, the shared ownership census and uac-r2 lineage files: auth and tenant-isolation code.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Security-relevant (auth, secure-wall ownership) across files owned by two other projects (uac-r2 lineage and census, ontology-owned guard), with binding review conditions.</model-tier-reason>
