    <parallel-reason>Edits uac-r2 files (SecureChildLineage.cs, RecordOwnershipResolver.cs, config/secure-record-owner-role.json) and the shared RecordOwnerAssignmentCensusTests; run /conflict-check before the PR.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>080</deps>
    <tags>bff, api, auth, tenant-isolation, testing, rules</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2-3 days</estimated-effort>
